ly from her vision, leadership, and expertise, and her contributions are expected to have a lasting impact on the institution\'s future. Overall, Prof. (Dr.) Shalya Raj is a highly respected and accomplished leader who has made significant contributions to the field of education and beyond. Her role as the CEO of Swami Vivekanand Subharti University is a testament to her capabilities, and her continued leadership is expected to drive the university\'s success in the years to come.",\n"confidence": "100",\n"main_entity": "document"\n}\n```'}, 'logprobs': None, 'finish_reason': 'stop'}], 'usage': {'queue_time': 0.044596677, 'prompt_tokens': 476, 'prompt_time': 0.009140143, 'completion_tokens': 447, 'completion_time': 0.673056065, 'total_tokens': 923, 'total_time': 0.682196208}, 'usage_breakdown': None, 'system_fingerprint': 'fp_c527aa4474', 'x_groq': {'id': 'req_01k6m8f4v3egg9tj20qqd6rc6n'}, 'service_tier': 'on_demand'}
